# A new version takes over exactly at the loop boundary, at the beat
# seq_submit_track() returned. Sent mid-loop; then sent while held
# exactly on a boundary (beat 12, not yet played), where it takes
# over at that boundary, not one loop later. A second submission
# before the takeover replaces the first.
